=\"_blank\">白頭鬃</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>1</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">張苡薰<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/04/17e.html\" target=\"_blank\">17歲ê酸甘甜</a></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span style=\"white-space: normal;\">2<br /><br /></span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">高嘉徽<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/04/blog-post_72.html\" target=\"_blank\">天色</a></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span style=\"white-space: normal;\">3<br /><br /></span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">張淑真<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/04/blog-post_43.html\" target=\"_blank\">菜蟲</a></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span style=\"white-space: normal;\">3<br /><br /></span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">王敏旭<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/04/blog-post_94.html\" target=\"_blank\">黃花風鈴木</a></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span style=\"white-space: normal;\">41</span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span style=\"white-space: normal;\"><br /></span></span></div><h3><span style=\"font-size: large;\">阿瑞--ā話仙</span></h3><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">藍春瑞<br /><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/04/blog-post_25.html\" target=\"_blank\">人艱苦</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>4</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></div><h3><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Lán來講看māi</span></h3><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">黃良成<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/04/e_9.html\" target=\"_blank\">「台灣上勇」春仔ê啟示</a></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span style=\"white-space: normal;\">6</span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span style=\"white-space: normal;\"><br /></span></span></div><h3><span style=\"font-size: large;\">心內話</span></h3><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">周瑞雅<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/04/kaiekah.html\" target=\"_blank\">上kài好ê恩典kah祝福</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>8</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">呂莛鈺<br /><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/04/me.html\" target=\"_blank\">我m̄是隔壁ê阿媽</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>9</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></div><h3><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Sann-kap讀小說</span></h3><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">雁&nbsp; &nbsp; 翎<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/04/mai-sio.html\" target=\"_blank\">一枝小雨傘（三）：Mài sio害</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>10</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">簡詠承<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/04/kahe.html\" target=\"_blank\">阿明kah紅龜粿ê相逢</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>13</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">作者／芥川龍之介</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">譯者／林東榮<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/04/blog-post_77.html\" target=\"_blank\">詩集</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>14</span></div><h3><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Sio招來看戲</span></h3><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">林映宋<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/04/blog-post_13.html\" target=\"_blank\">台語伴——廣播劇公演記事</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>16</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">下厝庄仔<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/04/e_30.html\" target=\"_blank\">看電影ê記持</a></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span style=\"white-space: normal;\">18</span></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span style=\"white-space: normal;\"><br /></span></span></div><h3><span style=\"font-size: large;\">台灣人寫真</span></h3><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">田美瑜<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/04/blog-post_17.html\" target=\"_blank\">大格雞慢啼</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>22</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">里&nbsp; &nbsp; 仔<br /><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/04/lioh.html\" target=\"_blank\">惜lio̍h</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>24</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">林秀真<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/04/e_14.html\" target=\"_blank\">舊厝ê記持</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>26</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></div><h3><span style=\"font-size: large;\">醫學台文</span></h3><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">羅九安<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/04/siunne-hoo.html\" target=\"_blank\">是按怎壓力siunn大ē hōo人生白頭毛？</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>28</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></div><h3><span style=\"font-size: large;\">寶島好食mi̍h</span></h3><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">張寶明<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/04/blog-post_59.html\" target=\"_blank\">皮刀米粉我有興頭</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>30</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">林幸雪<br /><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/04/phang-e.html\" target=\"_blank\">做pháng ê心適代</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>31</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">顏士致<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/04/blog-post_30.html\" target=\"_blank\">麵粉粿仔</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>32</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></div><h3><span style=\"font-size: large;\">生活ê藝術</span></h3><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">蔡桂珠<br /><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/04/blog-post_21.html\" target=\"_blank\">渡假中心——病院筆記</a><br />35</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">葉佳琪<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/04/blog-post_71.html\" target=\"_blank\">忝</a><br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span>36</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></div><h3><span style=\"font-size: large;\">台語sa攏有講座</span></h3><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">主講／翁渙瑤</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">記錄／涂軒豪<br /><span style=\"white-space: pre;\"></span><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/04/behmih-tie-hit.html\" target=\"_blank\">社區營造是beh營造啥mi̍h？</a></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><a href=\"https://tsbp.tgb.org.tw/2015/04/behmih-tie-hit.html\" target=\"_blank\">——我tī社區ê hit寡日子</a></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span style=\"white-space: normal;\">38</span></span></div></div></div><div><br /></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></div><span></span><div class=\"separator\"